      "notes": "Absolute maximum ratings (VCEO -45, -60, -80 V, IC -1.5 A); hFE1 25 at -5 mA, hFE2 by group at -150 mA (10: 63 to 160, 16: 100 to 250), hFE3 25 at -500 mA; VCE(sat) -0.5 V at 500 mA; VBE(on) -1 V at -0.5 A; TO-126 E1 C2 B3; the ordering information."
    }
  },
  "evidence": [
    "BD13610/BD13810/BD14010 63 160 BD13616/BD13816/BD14016 100 250",
